[b]v1.3.0 — Memorial[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Memorial tab[/b] in the F6 panel: the squad members you've lost, who killed them (and their faction), the game day, and the kills and KOs they had. Requested by Ne Variant. Thanks!
[*]"Squad losses" in the Statistics tab, and fallen characters are marked in the per-character list.
[*][b]@victims[/b] setting: "most frequent victims" can now list more than the top 5. Use a number or [i]@victims = all[/i] in achievements.txt. Requested by az455862.
[*]New metric for your own achievements: squad_deaths.
[/list]
Existing progress is kept. If you edited achievements.txt, merge your changes into the new file. Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
